镜头，f/1.4超大光圈，从人群的肩缝间隙中低角度仰拍，将背景的复古派对人群、水晶吊灯和彩色气球全部虚化成柔和的圆形光斑（散景），光斑呈温暖的琥珀色与淡粉色交织，让画面充满梦幻怀旧感。\n\n主光源为左后方45°的暖金色钨丝灯（色温3200K），从侧面勾勒出脸部的立体轮廓，并使发丝边缘呈现半透明的发光“金边”；右前方2米处放置一块白色泡沫反光板，以1:3的补光比例提亮面部暗部，保留颧骨和鼻梁的高光质感。皮肤保留真实的雀斑、毛孔与细纹，杜绝过度磨皮，让胶片颗粒细腻地附着在肌肤表面。\n\n调色精准模拟柯达金200胶片：高光带淡黄，阴影偏暖绿，肤色呈健康的蜜桃色。画面整体偏暖，高光轻微溢出，营造出80年代舞厅特有的氤氲氛围。中近景胸像构图，但利用“人群缝隙”这一前景区块链，使观众产生“从拥挤派对中偷窥她”的参与感。\n\n整体氛围怀旧、温暖、带着微醺的怅惘，如同《了不起的盖茨比》里黛西在派对喧闹中瞬间失神的那一秒。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 6, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [8], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [352.7222900390625, 716.0314331054688], "widgets_values": [1920, 1280, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "EmptySD3LatentImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptySD3LatentImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "dit", "links": [31], "label": "dit", "type": "SEEDVR2_DIT", "localized_name": "dit"}], "size": [307.6646423339844, 198], "pos": [949.3072509765625, 284.95806884765625], "widgets_values": ["seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors", "cuda:0", 32, false, "cpu", "sdpa"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "cache_model", "label": "cache_model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "cache_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "torch_compile_args", "label": "torch_compile_args", "type": "S